cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "rcgat-repro: reproduction package for direction-aware attention gating in dependency link prediction on npm and Maven"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for a study of direction-aware attention gating in
  directed dependency link prediction on npm and Maven.  It rebuilds both
  directed package-dependency graphs, calibrates an explicit TF-IDF content
  floor, trains a direction-aware gated GAT together with its ungated baseline
  and three structural baselines over ten seeds per graph, and reports paired
  intervals under a pre-specified judgment rule.  The headline result is a bounded
  null result for the gate, plus a protocol diagnosis (candidate-pool definition,
  content floor, checkpoint policy) and eight extension experiments.
